 "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25998604389811086"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1974803902687197"}]}, "change_log": "- Sadly a lot of modded versions of GRAB has been spreading recently, so this update is an attempt to make modding a lot harder:\n- All new bans are now device bans, so switching accounts will not get around them.\n- GRAB will now crash if it detects that the apk has been tampered with.\n- If the quest entitlement check fails, GRAB will now close.\n- Implemented quest attestation api to validate device and app integrity and limit server access if compromised.\n- More symbols are now stripped out of the libGRAB.so file, making disassembling a bit harder.", "created_date": 1774445638, "id": "25998604389811086", "version": "0.74.0", "version_code": 3553, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4104088956355944", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25998604389811086"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1774442555, "id": "25998201803184678", "version": "0.74.0", "version_code": 3549, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}